  id: event.scrap-trader
  displayName: Scrap Trader
  <Body>k__BackingField: A trader's barge, bristling with salvage, pulls alongside.
    "I deal in tech. One of yours for one of mine. Or I'll just buy yours."
  <Choices>k__BackingField:
  - Label: Trade an item
    Requirement: 2
    RequiredScraps: 0
    Chance: 1
    Outcomes:
    - Kind: 7
      Amount: 0
      Rarity: 0
      Stat: 0
    - Kind: 5
      Amount: 0
      Rarity: 1
      Stat: 0
    FailOutcomes: []
    ResultText: The trader picks something from your racks and hands over a crate
      in return.
    FailText: 
  - Label: Sell an item
    Requirement: 2
    RequiredScraps: 0
    Chance: 1
    Outcomes:
    - Kind: 7
      Amount: 0
      Rarity: 0
      Stat: 0
    - Kind: 0
      Amount: 60
      Rarity: 0
      Stat: 0
    FailOutcomes: []
    ResultText: '"Pleasure doing business."'
    FailText: 
  - Label: Move on
    Requirement: 0
    RequiredScraps: 0
    Chance: 1
    Outcomes: []
    FailOutcomes: []
    ResultText: The barge drifts back into the dark.
